    "is_stub": false,
    "source_overview": "In terms of its subjective effects, this compound feels closer to that of ketamine and MXE than more stimulating compounds of the same class such as 3-MeO-PCP, 2'-Oxo-PCE and PCP. It is therefore a more suitable ketamine substitute than many other popular arylcyclohexylamines. As of 2016, this compound is currently the best substitute for MXE that is widely available for purchase as it has a similar dosage range and similar subjective effects."
